      "message": "I thought stl wasn\u0027t applicable to object files, but looking at [1] it\u0027s clear it can affect the implicit dependencies, and that should also be reflected by the prebuilts.\n\nI\u0027ve changed the parent CL a bit to share more code between cc_object and cc_prebuilt_object, to help avoid more mistakes in this regard. It also adds sanitizer to cc_prebuilt_object, since that too can affect dependencies [2], although I don\u0027t think we need to support it here in the snapshot creation.\n\n[1] http://cs/aosp-master/build/soong/cc/stl.go?l\u003d162\u0026rcl\u003db8eefa8956090cd4fea0d2dfec91706bc9be9cbd\n[2] https://devops-console-stagingoss.corp.google.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cc/cc.go;l\u003d1588-1590;drc\u003d752edec2904d5c72e17a50ed0a439ddeac84b812",
